<%- include('partials/head') %>
<body class="ph-body">
<%- include('partials/nav') %>
<main id="main">
  <section class="ph-hero ph-container" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="ph-hero-copy">
      <p class="ph-eyebrow"><span class="ph-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span> Your own kind of podcast app</p>
      <h1 id="hero-title">Make room for<br>a <em>better listen.</em></h1>
      <p class="ph-lead">Personal recommendations, powered entirely on your device. Smart Lists and filters that organize your library. Settings that put you in control.</p>
      <div class="ph-actions"><a class="ph-button" href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/podhaven/id6744904018">Download on the App Store <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="ph-text-link" href="#features">Explore PodHaven <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a class="ph-text-link" href="/podhaven/guides">Take a guided tour <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      <p class="ph-availability">Made for iOS · Available now on the App Store</p>
    </div>
    <div class="ph-hero-stage">
      <span class="ph-stage-note">Your next good listen starts here.</span>
      <div class="ph-hero-phones"><%- include('partials/screenshot', { id: 'up-next', eager: true }) %><%- include('partials/screenshot', { id: 'smart-lists' }) %></div>
      <div class="ph-stage-label"><span aria-hidden="true">✳</span><span>Recommendations built around you.<br>A library that follows your rules.</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="ph-promise-strip"><div class="ph-container"><span>Recommendations, entirely on device</span><span>Smart Lists & flexible filters</span><span>Make every setting your own</span></div></div>

  <section class="ph-section ph-container" id="features" aria-labelledby="features-title">
    <div class="ph-section-heading"><div><p class="ph-eyebrow">A place for all your listening</p><h2 id="features-title">A lot to love.<br>A little less to manage.</h2></div><p>From your first subscription to your carefully sorted back catalog, the details are here.</p></div>
    <div class="ph-feature-index"><% let featureNumber = 0; for (const [key, feature] of Object.entries(features)) { featureNumber++; %><a class="ph-feature-entry" href="/podhaven/<%= key %>"><span class="ph-feature-number"><%= String(featureNumber).padStart(2, '0') %></span><div><h3><%= feature.label %></h3><p><%= feature.description %></p></div><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><% } %></div>
  </section>

  <section class="ph-band ph-band-green" aria-labelledby="recommendations-title"><div class="ph-container ph-showcase">
    <div class="ph-showcase-copy"><p class="ph-eyebrow">01 / Intelligence that stays on your device</p><h2 id="recommendations-title">Your taste.<br><em>Better understood.</em></h2><p>Love an episode? Tell PodHaven. Its recommendation model learns from your ratings and listening, with the model and scoring running entirely on your device.</p><p>Explore picks in Up Next and Search. See the reasons behind a recommendation, then choose whether to stay with familiar shows or try something new.</p><a class="ph-text-link" href="/podhaven/recommendations">Meet your recommendations <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="ph-small-note">Love · Like · Dislike · Not Interested<br>Different choices for different kinds of feedback.</div></div>
    <div class="ph-showcase-media"><%- include('partials/screenshot', { id: 'recommendation-detail' }) %><%- include('partials/screenshot', { id: 'recommendation-settings', compact: true }) %></div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="ph-band ph-band-peach" aria-labelledby="lists-title"><div class="ph-container ph-showcase ph-showcase-reverse">
    <div class="ph-showcase-copy"><p class="ph-eyebrow">02 / Your library, your rules</p><h2 id="lists-title">A short commute.<br>A <em>long curiosity.</em></h2><p>Make a list for either. Filter by listening state, duration, date, tags, ratings, or text. Collect unfinished episodes under 30 minutes, recent releases from favorite shows, or saved episodes for a long trip.</p><p>Combine All and Any conditions, choose your sort order, and let Smart Lists update as your library changes. Tag an entire show or just the episode you want to revisit.</p><a class="ph-text-link" href="/podhaven/smart-lists">Explore Smart Lists & filters <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
    <div class="ph-showcase-media"><%- include('partials/screenshot', { id: 'smart-lists' }) %><%- include('partials/screenshot', { id: 'smart-list-editor', compact: true }) %></div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="ph-band" aria-labelledby="customization-title"><div class="ph-container ph-showcase">
    <div class="ph-showcase-copy"><p class="ph-eyebrow">03 / Set it up for the way you listen</p><h2 id="customization-title">Every detail.<br><em>Your way.</em></h2><p>Choose your skip intervals, swipe actions, remote buttons, artwork, and appearance. Tune your recommendations and decide exactly how much goes into Up Next.</p><p>Give every show its own playback speed, automatic queueing, episode limit, download policy, freshness, and notifications. A daily briefing can follow a different routine from a long interview.</p><a class="ph-text-link" href="/podhaven/customization">Explore settings & customization <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="ph-small-note">Start with the defaults. Adjust the details whenever you need them.<br><a href="/podhaven/guides/settings">Find every setting in the guide</a>.</div></div>
    <div class="ph-showcase-media"><%- include('partials/screenshot', { id: 'podcast-settings' }) %><%- include('partials/screenshot', { id: 'swipe-settings', compact: true }) %></div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="ph-band ph-band-dark" aria-labelledby="player-title"><div class="ph-container ph-showcase ph-showcase-reverse">
    <div class="ph-showcase-copy"><p class="ph-eyebrow">04 / Right where you left off</p><h2 id="player-title">Set your pace.<br><em>Stay in the story.</em></h2><p>Shorten pauses with configurable silence skipping for downloaded episodes. Choose Gentle, Balanced, or Aggressive, and adjust Quiet Audio Protection to suit each show.</p><p>Set playback speed from 0.8× to 2.0×, choose independent skip intervals, and navigate chapters. Take Up Next, Smart Lists, and your podcasts on the road with CarPlay.</p><div class="ph-actions"><a class="ph-button" href="/podhaven/player">Tour the player <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="ph-text-link" href="/podhaven/player#silence-skipping">Silence skipping</a><a class="ph-text-link" href="/podhaven/player#carplay">Explore CarPlay</a></div></div>
    <div class="ph-showcase-media"><%- include('partials/screenshot', { id: 'player' }) %><%- include('partials/screenshot', { id: 'chapter-player', compact: true }) %></div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="ph-section ph-container" aria-labelledby="everyday-title">
    <div class="ph-section-heading"><div><p class="ph-eyebrow">Fits into your day</p><h2 id="everyday-title">Good company.<br>Wherever you listen.</h2></div><p>Download before you leave. Keep the next episode close. Bring your favorite shows along.</p></div>
    <div class="ph-everyday-grid">
      <article><%- include('partials/screenshot', { id: 'offline' }) %><h3>Ready to go offline.</h3><p>Download episodes and protect favorites with Save in Cache. Give temporary downloads a budget.</p><a class="ph-text-link" href="/podhaven/offline">Offline listening <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
      <article><%- include('partials/screenshot', { id: 'widgets' }) %><h3>A little closer to play.</h3><p>Home Screen and Lock Screen widgets, plus dedicated Control Center playback controls.</p><a class="ph-text-link" href="/podhaven/customization#widgets">Widgets & controls <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
      <article><%- include('partials/screenshot', { id: 'library' }) %><h3>All your shows, together.</h3><p>Search and charts, manual RSS feeds, OPML import and export, and links you can share.</p><a class="ph-text-link" href="/podhaven/library">Explore your library <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ph-band ph-band-green" aria-labelledby="transcripts-title"><div class="ph-container ph-transcript-callout">
    <div class="ph-showcase-copy"><p class="ph-eyebrow">Transcripts, when you want the words</p><h2 id="transcripts-title">Read along.<br><em>Revisit a thought.</em></h2><p>Generate a transcript on your device, or read one supplied by the podcast when available. Follow the words in the player, then return to the episode to read at your own pace.</p><div class="ph-actions"><a class="ph-text-link" href="/podhaven/transcripts">Explore transcripts <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="ph-text-link" href="/podhaven/guides/transcripts">Read the transcript guide</a></div></div>
    <%- include('partials/screenshot', { id: 'transcript-player' }) %>
  </div></section>

  <section class="ph-guide-promo"><div class="ph-container"><div class="ph-section-heading"><div><p class="ph-eyebrow">The listening guide</p><h2>A few minutes here.<br>More from every listen.</h2></div><a class="ph-button" href="/podhaven/guides">Browse all nine guides <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="ph-mini-guides"><% for (const key of ['getting-started', 'training-recommendations', 'smart-lists', 'settings']) { %><a href="/podhaven/guides/<%= key %>"><span class="ph-eyebrow"><%= guides[key].label %></span><h3><%= guides[key].title %></h3><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><% } %></div></div></section>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
